@startuml seq_view_adjust_trip
!include style.iuml
title View & Adjust Trip

actor Traveller
participant "Android App" as App
participant "Trip\nEngine" as Engine
participant "Trip Sync &\nDisruption Service" as Sync
database MongoDB
participant "Other members'\nAndroid Apps" as Party

Traveller -> App : opens a trip from the recent trips or a group's page
App -> Engine : GET /api/trips/{tripId}
alt trip missing, or the traveller is not in its group
  Engine --> App : 404 { error: "Trip not found" }
  App --> Traveller : "Trip not found" with Try again
end
Engine --> App : 200 TripDto
App -> Sync : Socket.io connect (auth: session token), then subscribe { tripId }
Sync -> Engine : getTrip(userId, tripId) (may this traveller listen?)
Sync --> App : acknowledgement { ok: true }
App --> Traveller : the timeline, marked "Live"
Traveller -> App : locks, unlocks, moves, removes or marks a stop visited, or taps Re-plan on a day
App -> Engine : POST /api/trips/{tripId}/adjust\n{ action, version, dayIndex, activityId, toIndex?, fromTime? }
Engine -> MongoDB : findTrip(tripId), listActivities(city), cached travel times
alt the version is not the latest
  Engine --> App : 409 { error }
  App -> Engine : GET /api/trips/{tripId}
  App --> Traveller : "Someone changed this plan first. Here is the latest version."
else no feasible day keeps the change
  Engine --> App : 422 { error: "<stop> cannot go there: a stop would miss its opening hours or the day would run late" }
  App --> Traveller : explains why; the plan stays as it was
else
  Engine -> Engine : repairs the day: locked stops keep their times,\na removed stop's time goes to another activity
  Engine -> MongoDB : saveDay(if version unchanged), version + 1
  Engine -> Sync : trip changed (trip, actorId, summary)
  Sync -> App : tripUpdated { trip, actorId, summary }
  Sync -> Party : tripUpdated { trip, actorId, summary }
  Engine --> App : 200 TripDto
  App --> Traveller : the timeline shows the change
  Party --> Party : shows the change with "Ava removed English Bay Beach"
end
opt the live connection is lost
  App --> Traveller : "Offline: live updates will resume when you reconnect"
  App -> Sync : reconnects and subscribes again
  App -> Engine : GET /api/trips/{tripId} (the latest version)
end
@enduml
